  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>UPSC and software engineering differ in how selection works, how long results take and how much risk you carry, and many people choose by setting an honest attempt window with a backup plan rather than an all-or-nothing leap.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities include choosing a branch early and building a high-income skill portfolio of finished work, because AI can handle routine tasks but cannot take responsibility for your results.
  </p>

